{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運硬地滾球賽事，梁育榮和張沅在混合BC4級雙打四強賽， 以5:2擊敗泰國隊，晉級決賽，坐銀望金，明天將與國家隊爭奪金牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n謝德樺和陳可欣就在混合BC3級雙打四強賽，以1:6不敵日本隊，明天將與泰國隊爭奪銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n龍子健、陳柏麟、楊曉林，在混合BC1/BC2級團體賽四強，以1:8不敵泰國隊，明天將與韓國隊爭奪銅牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:03:51.004884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:37:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:19.683966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:58:18.183576+00:00","content_hash":"f5844746242ac1937c8ba0db24c5c73c16a12e21a209d75c353b7ccda9686b75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}